WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.358
The identifier is visible. Why is the result missing?

00:00:40.358 --> 00:01:16.317
Out of whose vocabulary?

00:01:16.317 --> 00:01:51.381
A reader’s decomposition need not be the model’s

00:01:51.381 --> 00:02:29.675
Encoding coverage and useful meaning are separate properties

00:02:29.675 --> 00:03:13.723
Exact identity can be preserved without semantic training

00:03:13.723 --> 00:03:50.523
A pooled representation can blur a decisive distinction

00:03:50.523 --> 00:04:30.927
When exact identity determines relevance, keep a lexical route

00:04:30.927 --> 00:05:15.167
Test the layers before choosing the repair
